        ":question/problem": "If $A$ is a $6\\times 11$ matrix that has $8$ **non-pivot** columns, then $\\text{rank}(A)=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(A)$ is the number of pivot columns in $A.$ \n\nSince $A$ has $11$ columns and $8$ of them are non-pivots, then the number of pivot columns in $A$ is \n\n$$\n11-8=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(A)=3.$",
